 any point $P$ in the manner described above, it would not rotate. Therefore, $\\text{curl}\\,F=0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since $\\text{curl}\\,F=0,$ the vector field $F$ is irrotational.\n\n- Statement IV is false. Since $\\text{curl}\\,F=0,$ it points in neither the positive nor the negative $z$-direction.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186241116 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d42243ea-58fc-53f6-a0b6-f995bf1d697c" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting the Curl of a Vector Field"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d6da5be-dab7-5557-9faa-e9c458176103" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437486} {:answer/id #uuid "c92cf9d4-7709-5ceb-b895-b546ae07415c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437487}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0d6da5be-dab7-5557-9faa-e9c458176103" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437486} :answer-field/id #uuid "e7e9da93-54af-5e26-8cfa-2245f93b43c5" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438772} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5983dd24-2080-5825-8480-5f2274507dcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437488} {:answer/id #uuid "0e102cb8-95ed-551e-b324-574d91856376" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437489}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e102cb8-95ed-551e-b324-574d91856376" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437489} :answer-field/id #uuid "9976f639-ca02-5381-b2aa-6395e8fa240c" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438773} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid